{"title":"2014 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/0/9b0ace63ea7b678d4066d3fd7e918936ce1c6300.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + 2y = 14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"96\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/8/6389a3877e2c9d09826aa0c5e5aa564d8c355afa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"16\" />, what is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/4/ad448c942032df6fe4b8dd232912bbe6afc8cfed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x + 3y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"62\" height=\"17\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Doubling the first equation, we get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/b/dab79989f68932706667d5b11b6cbc3e9c5c221b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2(x + 2y) = 2(14)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"142\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/2/992e32d043292b4467f7c9abe18d2431908ed197.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x + 4y = 28$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"105\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p>Subtracting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/0/b306e4e9eabea431f45fdd9a29e5077324bb0500.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x + 3y = 28 - y = 28 - 3 = \\boxed{25}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"264\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/8/6389a3877e2c9d09826aa0c5e5aa564d8c355afa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/0/9b0ace63ea7b678d4066d3fd7e918936ce1c6300.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + 2y = 14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"96\" height=\"17\" />, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/6/b769783dc995fc8fec36196bdf48762675fe2b20.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + 2 \\times 3 = 14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"117\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/2/702b41083870db996d38ace5f5bf34cab05cb6b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + 6 = 14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"86\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/4/0f4a3d5fb57df54a5baaf38526557aa9de7a12d3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 14 - 6 = 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"119\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/4/62434ae80ca145c20f0fbc7563f5151371ed163c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/8/6389a3877e2c9d09826aa0c5e5aa564d8c355afa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"16\" />:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/8/3c8d7eba2f4414bdea4202a28c5485f89444e701.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x + 3y = 2 \\times 8 + 3 \\times 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"189\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/d/eedebd6f0f7b4814d49746a0a72c2c58a57bc00d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=16 + 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"71\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/3/543687a7e6fe26a92ec0b00ffc755d3dd3806b19.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\boxed{25}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"50\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CIMC\" title=\"2014 CIMC\">2014 CIMC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CIMC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CIMC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CIMC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CIMC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_1\" title=\"2014 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 1\">Part A Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_3\" title=\"2014 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 3\">Part A Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_1\" title=\"2014 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 1\">Part A 1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Part A 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_3\" title=\"2014 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 3\">Part A 3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_4\" title=\"2014 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 4\">Part A 4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 5 (page does not exist)\">Part A 5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 6 (page does not exist)\">Part A 6</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 1 (page does not exist)\">Part B 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 2 (page does not exist)\">Part B 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">Part B 3</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CEMC_Intermediate_Competition\" title=\"CEMC Intermediate Competition\">CEMC Intermediate Competition</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018060231\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.020 seconds\nReal tim